cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PharmaML Toolkit in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "PharmaML Toolkit: Offline-first pharmaceutical machine learning"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PharmaML contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MrMMA2004/pharma-ml-toolkit"
url: "https://github.com/MrMMA2004/pharma-ml-toolkit"
license: MIT
version: 1.2.160
date-released: 2026-11-10
abstract: >-
  PharmaML Toolkit is an offline-first Python package for cheminformatics,
  QSAR, pharmacokinetics and pharmacodynamics, molecular docking,
  explainable and generative machine learning, reproducible scientific
  reports and visualization. It includes a PySide6 desktop Studio,
  a Next.js web console, executed notebooks and versioned source archives.
keywords:
  - pharmaceutical-informatics
  - cheminformatics
  - QSAR
  - pharmacokinetics
  - pharmacometrics
  - molecular-docking
  - explainable-ai
  - machine-learning
  - reproducible-research
